🔓 Crack the Gate 1 — Writeup
📋 What's the Challenge?
You're given a login page. You need to get in. But instead of guessing the password, you find a secret shortcut hidden in the code. 🕵️

🎯 What You're Working With
Item	Value
📧 Email	ctf-player@picoctf.org
🌐 Endpoint	POST /login
🧩 Difficulty	Easy (Beginner)

👀 Step 1: Look at the Page Source
Open the page in your browser → Right-click → "View Page Source"

You'll find a hidden comment that looks like nonsense:

ABGR: Wnpx - grzcbenel olcnff: hfr urnqre K-Qri-Npprff: lrf

🤔 "What is this?? Random letters?"

Nope! It's a code.


